cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  The manuscript associated with this results package was submitted to
  Data & Knowledge Engineering on 2026-08-14 and has not yet been accepted
  or assigned a DOI. Until publication, please cite this dataset directly
  or contact the corresponding author for guidance.
type: dataset
title: "NoiseProj-CF: Public Results and Evidence Data"
abstract: >-
  Processed result tables supporting the manuscript "NoiseProj-CF:
  Noise-Adjusted Low-Rank Indexing for Compact and Corruption-Robust Dense
  Retrieval". The release covers six BEIR datasets and three frozen
  sentence-embedding encoders under the qrel-free, document-calibrated
  protocol 4.0.2-final, including effectiveness, compression, corruption
  generalization, transfer, system trade-offs, sensitivity diagnostics,
  and statistical inference.
